{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211003001:0":{"text":"이곳에도 고블린이 있네요... 정말 끈질긴 생명체예요. 어디에 있어도 살아남을 수 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"这里也有咕布林，它们可真顽强呀，好像在哪里都能生存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4688E9B94D59D62D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1211003002:0":{"text":"귀여워! 귀여운 친구들이 나랑 놀고 싶대!","source_cn":"可爱！可爱它们想和我玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09838A71C7E55509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211003003:0":{"text":"그건 네 착각이야. 고블린은 널 공격하려는 거라고!","source_cn":"你理解错了，它们是想攻击你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24CA4C6C45C7D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}